---@field requiresReinstallation? boolean True when changing app token grants requires reinstalling the app, so tokens cannot be partitioned independently by requester environment.
---@field scopes? vercel.connect.ConnectConnectorCreateResultAppTokensScopesList Known allowed app-level scopes. For Slack this is the bot scope set configured on the app; for OAuth it is the connector's enabled `clientCredentials.scopes` configuration.
---@field supportedAuthorizationDetails? vercel.connect.ConnectConnectorCreateResultAppTokensSupportedAuthorizationDetailsList Supported OAuth authorization-detail type names.
